{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"“He nev-er threat-ened your life.” He frowns. “He threat-ened to board your ship and… smash your stuff. Like you did.”","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:11:57.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868903416204787744","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
