{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"That's not how I remember it...\" but he pauses.","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:13:46.643000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868903872440201296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"The guy buzzed out of town as soon as he got the chance. Heading to Europe\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:14:15.713000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868903994368606248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"The brain often creates ends to justify the means.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:14:18.025000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904004065837147","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"No, you were there, you heard...\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:15:17.223000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904252360228884","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"“And… des-pite what was done to him… he gave us in-for-mation. On Bu-chan-an. Or… Ja-cob the Bard… as he is known now.”","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:15:25.848000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904288536117278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Memories are not foolproof, Apgan.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:15:53.419000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904404177276938","reply_to_id":"868904252360228884","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
