{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"He sits down at the chair by his desk.","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:17:00.147000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904684054777877","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"“I am sure… you per-ceived a threat. And act-ed as such. But he is… still a man. Who looks out… for him-self. He did not seem… a kill-er.”","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:17:05.309000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904705705779220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"...\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:17:20.660000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904770092556309","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"“What is… it, Ap-gan?”","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:17:21.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904774970511400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I feel sick.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:17:35.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904831300038656","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"What have you done?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:17:55.896000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868904917883039785","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I've been running around filled with rage and paranoia for the past day.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:18:57.946000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905178139603025","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I took his blood for our records.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:19:27.571000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905302395863110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"“Per-haps… a re-sult of your brain be-ing remade.”","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:19:46.280000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905380867096626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"The arrest was a false arrest--without the threat there was no assault.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:19:49.795000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905395610058814","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Nolan destroyed it, there's no problem.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:20:04.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905455638945812","reply_to_id":"868905302395863110","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"The search was illegal, and all he threatened me with was breaking my things?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:20:11.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905487867973642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I knew I screwed up, I knew it, and I'm sorry I called you a chump but this is worse than I thought.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:20:39.492000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905604054409307","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Nolan will go over to Apgan, putting a hand on his shoulder.","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:20:47.256000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905636618977280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"“I for-give what you said. But we must… work to rem-ed-y your act-ions. We can-not use our pow-er to opp-ress, like the Crown.”","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:21:51.572000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868905906379849749","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"It wasn't the ravens. This was me. This is how I've always been. This is how I got kicked out of the tribe.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:22:15.416000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868906006388813864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Someone insulted me and I just did it all over again. Without the slightest hesitation.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:23:36.844000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868906347922612244","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"“Do you… want to change this? How you… re-spond?”","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:24:55.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868906679239073843","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"...yes?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:25:28.516000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868906816308932678","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I mean, I don't want to hurt people like this again.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:25:39.455000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868906862190420008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"But when I imagine myself in those situations again the rage just comes back, strong as ever.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:25:55.234000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868906928372346930","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"And I can't imagine behaving any other way.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:26:17.415000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868907021406203944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"It felt like he was escalating as hard as I was. But he took the high road every step of the way. I just wanted him to be the villain.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:27:09.295000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868907239006683206","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Guardians, can we send a courier at least?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:28:29.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868907576128053279","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
