{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"To my recent prisoner,\n    I have erred, grievously. I have insulted your person and caused you to fear for your safety. You, in response, have acted in a manner most becoming a gentleman at every step of the way. I have erred by performing a search on your vessel without probable cause or even jurisdiction, conducted in a hasty and unscrupulous manner in order to intimidate you. In response, you made an idle, mild threat, which I mistook as a grievous threat to my life. Then, I abused you most grievously while believing myself justified at every step of the way, including while depriving you of your bodily integrity and autonomy. My actions have shamed me beyond words. Despite all this, you have deigned to provide my superior with the knowledge we sought. We had an agreed on price of 600 gold for that information. I must insist that I pay it, if only so that I may make a token effort to amend my misdeeds. If you should choose to present this confession before a magistrate, I will verify that every word in it is true, and backed up by the evidence in the lamplighter offices.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:55:55.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868914479100985414","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
